        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5100E, Egg Keyed Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Egg Knob with Regular Rose will fit most standard pre-drill door preparations. This Keyed Egg Knobset will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The keyed entry function is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. It is also available in a dummy function, which does not lock or latch. The Egg Keyed Knob with Round Rose utilizes a Schlage C keyway, so you can get this front door knob keyed alike to use the same key as other locks also using the same type of keyway. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/egg-knob-with-regular-rosette-emtek-8050e\"><b>Egg Knob with Regular Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Traditional Egg Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Dimeter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Keyed Egg Knob with Regular Rose",
                "description": "The Keyed Egg Knob with Regular Rose will fit most standard pre-drill door preparations. This Keyed Egg Knobset will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The keyed entry function is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. It is also available in a dummy function, which does not lock or latch. The Egg Keyed Knob with Round Rose utilizes a Schlage C keyway, so you can get this front door knob keyed alike to use the same key as other locks also using the same type of keyway.",
                "keywords": "Keyed Egg Knob with Regular Rosettes,  Emtek Traditional Egg Knob with Round Roses, Egg Keyed Knob with Round Roses, Keyed Egg Knob with Regular Roses, Emtek 5100E, Emtek 5150E, EMT-5100E,  traditional knobs,"
            },
